@beverage_order_system_HostAddress = http://localhost:5234

GET {{beverage_order_system_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Get Menu Item

GET {{beverage_order_system_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menu?pageindex=1&pagesize=100
Accept: application/json

### Add Menu Item
POST {{beverage_order_system_HostAddress}}/api/v1/menu/new-item
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "milk coffee",
    "categoryid": 0,
    "baseprice": 0,
    "isavailable": true    
}